  "setupInstructions": [
    "1. Open Google Play Console -> Grow users -> Play Games Services -> Setup and management -> Achievements.",
    "2. Add supported languages under Play Games Services -> Configuration (az-AZ, en-US, ru-RU).",
    "3. Create each of the 14 achievements below (or prepare AchievementsMetadata.csv + AchievementsLocalizations.csv without header rows + 512x512 icons in a ZIP).",
    "4. Copy the generated Achievement IDs (CgkI...) from Play Console into google-play-achievements/games-ids.xml (android/app/src/main/res/values/games-ids.xml) and src/services/playGamesAchievements.ts.",
    "5. Publish the Play Games Services configuration changes in Google Play Console."
  ],
